  ## `PlayerInteractEvent` (action is the WIT `interact-action` case: 0 left-click-block, 1 left-click-air,
  ## 2 right-click-air, 3 right-click-block): true when cancelled.


# Workaround (COMPILER-BUGS.md): hexer asserts on a call of an imported global closure variable, so importers call this.
